# App-authored briefing, not from a tape. Grounded in the public description
# retained in levels.json and the unverified secondary overview at
# library/reference/focus-levels-overview.md. No tape or manual in the library
# describes Focus 18. The body states that footing and offers the love-energy
# description as a proposition for observation, not a required sensation.

@segment     briefing-f18
@title       Focus 18 — The Heart Level
@levels      F18
@verbosity   2
@protected   Focus 18
@duration    ~1m

say You are now in Focus 18.
pause 5
say No tape or manual in this library describes this level. The available description comes from public summary material, so hold it lightly.
pause 6
say That material associates Focus 18 with working in unconditional love energy, cultivating it in yourself, and carrying it into daily life with those close to you.
pause 8
say Treat that as a proposition to test, not a feeling you are required to produce.
pause 6
say Observe what is actually present for you, without forcing it to match the description.
pause 12
say Remember what you notice. Your attributed account may confirm, amend, or reject the available map.
pause 10
